-09-30T17:14:28Z", "repo": "stim-call-analysis", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "50054e98cc4c0e58478c0f335e2d81512cb2dc59", "message": "respiratory rate, parameter standardizn, bug fixes\n\nMain Changes\n- s4_segment_breaths\n    - respiratory rate computed from inspiration to inspiration; NaN for trials with only 1 insp crossing and warning for trials with less than 2 full breath cycles\n    - changes supporting window parameter standardization\n- pharmacology_plot_pipeline\n    - add timeseries: respiratory rate, insp amp, exp amp as f(trial)\n    - fix a bug that didn't plot/save expiratory amplitude multihistogram\n\nOther Changes\n- default_params\n    - enable passing empty input to fetch default params\n    - fix some windowing\n        - separate windows for call (incl. exp amp), insp onset, and insp amp\n        - standardize most windows to 2x1 array of time (ms) with respect stim onset (vs scalar values and/or time in frames)\n- batch_plot_breaths\n    - fetch most values from parameter struct or data struct\n    - add breath zero crossings\n    - normalize ylim across ALL conditions and trials in a data struct\n- main\n    - merge_files option: false can keep each RHS file as a separate row in proc_data struct\n- pipeline/s3_segment_calls\n    - changes supporting window parameter standardization\n- s1_load_raw\n    - gets datetime from filename & adds it to unproc_data struct; struct is sorted by this field. also adds filename to each struct row\n- s2_restructure\n    - maintains filename and counts rejected stimulations per file\n- save_files_pipeline\n    - specify v7.3 m file so big files (>2gb) aren't skipped\n- pu65bk36.csv\n    - change tab separator to comma (matlab csv parsing didn't like it)", "created_at": "2024-08-27T16:35:13Z", "repo": "stim-call-analysis", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "39381b9adcdeec28705a6ffcd138c4d42a24dfa9", "message": "add all stim histograms for dmpam", "created_at": "2024-08-22T17:03:07Z", "repo": "stim-call-analysis", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1d7003d751288ee252e445a6fd254a0c92c26c4b", "message": "small changes to batch plot trials breaths/spectrograms", "created_at": "2024-08-22T16:50:02Z", "repo": "stim-call-analysis", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8e63f896d21e1e18c13f54a21487b4e1d5c9b175", "message": "further explore hvc pharm breathing\n\n- split out `dmpam_group_comparisons` into a separate file\n- `pipeline`:\n    - make csv loading more reliable\n    - add `suppress_reprocess` capability\n- `s4_segment_breaths`:\n    - rename `exp_amp_window_fr` --> `amp_window_fr` & also use for insp amplitude determination (instead of `insp_window_length_ms`, used to calculate latency, which is too small)\n    - change `pre_stim_amp_normalize_window` from [-0.5 0]s --> [-1 0]s before stim; ensure >=1 repetition of waveform for slow respiratory rate conditions\n    - add respiratory rate computation\n- new plots:\n    - `run_pharmacology_analyses`: all_stims.respiratory_rate pre/post\n    - `pharmacology_plot_pipeline`:\n        - insp vs. exp amplitude scatter\n        - respiratory rate histogram\n        - call success vs. insp amp\n- add `batch_plot_breaths`\n    - plots breath traces annotated with locations of interest\n    - recomputes these, but can crosscheck whether re-computed values match already computed values\n- change `batch_plot_spectrograms` parameters", "created_at": "2024-08-08T01:38:40Z", "repo": "stim-call-analysis", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "057492e4ed84a13049a5edd088d69032c820b3b3", "message": "all stim plots, exp latency, docs, refactors, etc\n\n- also fixed acoustic features: formerly computed on filt/rect/smoothed wave, which is not super meaningful.\n- docs to be completed", "created_at": "2024-08-06T16:54:40Z", "repo": "stim-call-analysis", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ff556c008926eb1cd6cfba8ee9a3850cc00ca0ad", "message": "add pharmacology summary stats", "created_at": "2024-07-19T17:25:33Z", "repo": "stim-call-analysis", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e47838bb0d1e3f45ca8d950d580d850ddaf7da59", "message": "dm pam stats", "created_at": "2024-07-19T16:55:38Z", "repo": "stim-call-analysis", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "429a82f151ce9501dc4adec66bc68b346f7b3d8b", "message": "summary stats & wilcoxon sign rank test for pharmacology data", "created_at": "2024-07-19T15:37:25Z", "repo": "stim-call-analysis", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "949749de714a0ba7cf00c132f4bf705acb003192", "message": "all-stim plots; datastruct for sharing; see commit details\n\n- fix amplitudes (normalize to pre)\n- add call success rate plots\n- add plots for all stims (not just call-evoking stims)\n- save centered breathing in breathing_audio data struct\n- read data from slightly different intan structure (board_dig_in_data vs. amp_settle_data)", "created_at": "2024-07-12T21:59:11Z", "repo": "stim-call-analysis", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ba53c26e90a1ffd28aa8b5606155d4cfc1026ed9", "message": "update pk30gr9 call segmentation parameters", "created_at": "2024-07-11T20:27:52Z", "repo": "stim-call-analysis", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dc15ec461d0f71da73439e90ad9fb5e8f2d0415a", "message": "reorganize dm/pam stim parameter files", "created_at": "2024-07-11T20:27:00Z", "repo": "stim-call-analysis", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "40b9554be815f5ddaa9392ee24cce40d07bbff33", "message": "pharmacology comparisons: multi-histograms, pre-post, comparison direction files", "cr